  "title": "Bailey's Irish Cupcakes",
  "description": "Sweet golden-brown cupcakes with the flavor of Irish cream liqueur are quick to whip up. Frost them with whipped cream or your favorite frosting.",
  "authors": [
    "Claire"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:47:45-04:00",
